  s0: Readback not prepared
  s1: Intent has mismatched bindings
  s2: Fresh intent, old verifier
  s3: Intent rejected
  s4: Readback held on stale source
  s5: Merged verifier installed, timers off
  s6: Fresh intent, merged verifier
