  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: an intent has mismatched state, host-key, or signature inputs
  s0 --> s2: the owner signs a fresh intent for the verified state and host keys
  s1 --> s3: the controller rejects invalid readback inputs
  s2 --> s4: readback finds the installed source pin is stale
  s3 --> s1: an intent has mismatched state, host-key, or signature inputs
  s3 --> s2: the owner signs a fresh intent for the verified state and host keys
  s4 --> s1: an intent has mismatched state, host-key, or signature inputs
  s4 --> s2: the owner signs a fresh intent for the verified state and host keys
  s4 --> s5: the protected installer updates the verifier and leaves timers off
  s5 --> s1: an intent has mismatched state, host-key, or signature inputs
  s5 --> s6: the owner signs a fresh intent for the verified state and host keys
  s6 --> s7: a fresh one-use intent passes readback
  s3 --> s6: the owner signs a fresh intent for the verified state and host keys
